      "text": "\\subsubsection*{Heckenberger row 5} We have $d=1$ and then $\\ell_1 = \\frac{\\ell}{gdc(\\ell,2)}$. Moreover $\\ell \\neq 2,4$, because $q^2 \\neq \\pm 1$, and since $c_{12}=-2$ we have the following: If $\\ell > 6 $ or $\\ell = 5$ then by classification Lemma~\\ref{superlieclassification} we get a unique solution, presented in Section~\\ref{SuperLie} Heckenberger row~5."
